{"title":"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the sequence defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eef25a8dc16491072fdf50a267c9bad9049121b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k =\\dfrac{1}{k^2+k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"94\" height=\"38\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/7/c779d0ba2c47e7587d30a6d8c860c8d24603fa32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/d/28ddc180d01b6a7befae19be8c1d99c0d67031fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m+a_{m+1}+\\cdots+a_{n-1}=\\dfrac{1}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"229\" height=\"37\" />, for positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/c/3cc5d678e78938bc0ceb0fed5e5694362b69fb36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&lt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" />, find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Partial_fraction_decomposition\" title=\"Partial fraction decomposition\">partial fraction decomposition</a> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa76bf85b28112280f60fa9e58958a17ce2c2a94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{k^2+k}=\\dfrac{1}{k(k+1)}=\\dfrac{1}{k}-\\dfrac{1}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"255\" height=\"43\" />. Thus,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/b/e7b7a688266bab708849b9afda124b0e60529489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m+a_{m+1}+\\cdots +a_{n-1}=\\dfrac{1}{m}-\\dfrac{1}{m+1}+\\dfrac{1}{m+1}-\\dfrac{1}{m+2}+\\cdots +\\dfrac{1}{n-1}-\\dfrac{1}{n}=\\dfrac{1}{m}-\\dfrac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"678\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Which means that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/3/11361d509f4d019384c95013e775e37bae919cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{n-m}{mn}=\\dfrac{1}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Since we need a factor of 29 in the denominator, we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/8/e08568276b47b5f8d6c673882df962830ce87fe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=29t$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" />.* Substituting, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e42d2542b6d080a21b95510f8f3d5ce17a75735d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29t-m=mt$\" width=\"109\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79cef3db53a0e40e0db213010337b91eca8f4918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{29t}{t+1} = m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"81\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/5/4451b688714830dd079dbb041508f427070f29bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t+1 = 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/4/c34211be39ddb7741b409a597393852016cfe940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=28$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />. It quickly follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28ecb1498159c886172b182aebb91420c3d74911.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=29(28)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/1/d517eb07b2aaa054845faf9d389e84b07d6e0ad6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=28$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff71db52d810136c66d5ea7697bc2be99cfd83c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = 30(28) = \\fbox{840}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p>\n<pre>*If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/4/ac46ca87f68775cc7fb4f1c05f362b317f03eebb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=29t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" />, a similar argument to the one above implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/6/566bf866cc174d5cfd2a2c3ffb902bbb19b1a019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=29(28)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6ab729da527d74d526a3c840498ca36eef77f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=28$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c1867cd31fa2542f75b0c24655922d93ce901d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" />. This is impossible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/2/0320419c5ad827709dd84a8269476ff3d9a54766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-m&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />.\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea78eda02ba400e55eb52e9e44d19259af9a1aad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + a_2 + \\cdots + a_i = \\dfrac{i}{i+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"201\" height=\"39\" />. This can be proven by induction. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/1/5e19b324493850abb62a9af7a9a69fd6925876a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum\\limits_{i=m}^{n-1} a_i = \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n-1} a_i - \\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{m-1} a_i = \\dfrac{n-1}{n} - \\dfrac{m-1}{m} = \\dfrac{n-m}{mn} = 1/29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"463\" height=\"50\" />. Cross-multiplying yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/a/c0aef8110e2594b1d4f5b6dd7b961e88a7577ce5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29n - 29m - mn = 0$\" width=\"167\" height=\"12\" />, and adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd81b0717e30a5e25ea6bd7c76751d4cc27a9a79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29^2$\" width=\"24\" height=\"15\" /> to both sides gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/7/357c96eff7b80ad4d92b2da25b73ec6f4ae71eee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(29-m)(29+n) = 29^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"184\" height=\"19\" />. Clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/e/85e87b7adb27d5135c3007bb90f28332c69c78aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; n \\implies 29 - m = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"189\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9e196b06221278129051460c1bfa12a59a3418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29 + n = 29^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f398c8f4327bfa152d2df5cc584be979b932ced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 28$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b8bb14c4ccd174d49a86d9dee5e3c484b8a2130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 812$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/c/fdc097ca0687e564162837cd4a6826508a4201ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = \\fbox{840}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"22\" />.\n</p><p>~ keeper1098\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To solve this problem, I need to find two positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2142770fa24b44536073e58e97ca948a989965.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"10\" /> and the sum of sequence terms equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c297bffd13ef9db4de77540e4ded8379df922aae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>First, let me simplify <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f9444a094866986caa155524424d912637a203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k = \\frac{1}{k^2 + k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"98\" height=\"40\" /> using partial fractions.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/b/f0b065df172f8340abf50e8bd3a79e5c827a17e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k = \\frac{1}{k(k+1)} = \\frac{1}{k} - \\frac{1}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"219\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>Express the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/3/2134de865f43942ab2148ff40b42efba314368bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m + a_{m+1} + \\cdots + a_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"187\" height=\"16\" /> using this simplification.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/0/c507becbdcf051039ad0933d0b46562eedc06088.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m + a_{m+1} + \\cdots + a_{n-1} = \\sum_{k=m}^{n-1} \\left(\\frac{1}{k} - \\frac{1}{k+1}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"351\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p>This is a telescoping series where intermediate terms cancel:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e6191ec1ccbec022da31f64c362ac8548d45856f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m + a_{m+1} + \\cdots + a_{n-1} = \\frac{1}{m} - \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"268\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Use the given condition that this sum equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c297bffd13ef9db4de77540e4ded8379df922aae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce589842c7d855e40d03e6e146e6b54a659753d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{m} - \\frac{1}{n} = \\frac{1}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"105\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150c08478d63c3d2f5cc0de4222ea9183673d7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn$\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/a/75ac78f665efd0a0110da7cf764f1963a320350e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n - m = \\frac{mn}{29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>Rearranging:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/3/dc34da1383f14bf1b00e8bea6b7f22d70bff09eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29(n - m) = mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/4/b54069f54b6eb9effb42bb81c2e7402a53e35aa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29n - 29m = mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/944a74d4733bad81707dc2030f168331dddf6e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29n - mn = 29m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"138\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ae658abc76a89557d7d0bd3dae0909f1008d4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n(29 - m) = 29m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0d2068cd498af3bc0365fbcefd7cd1df043e96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{29m}{29-m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"97\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be a positive integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da61ac8def4eb997b01fa424b669636da0a20f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> must divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/e/88e2fe582feab414eee45048bb48834c760455eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> evenly.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0657f5cd42256c0a39d45b265235e2a939625515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> is prime, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da61ac8def4eb997b01fa424b669636da0a20f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/e/88e2fe582feab414eee45048bb48834c760455eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> (when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8f73de23891c2820e94a00798149c8387fb9279.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />), we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/a/1da61ac8def4eb997b01fa424b669636da0a20f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29-m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> to divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5b759a35a0caa45c00dd4b339185ea0285ea02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = k(29-m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" /> for some positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc5b759a35a0caa45c00dd4b339185ea0285ea02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = k(29-m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/a/4eacbcc0e543ff79ec9a5a7f927eab376f6c282c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 29k - km$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbb86e836ca9d735da923e2a1d98a1feac8f6d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m(1+k) = 29k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"126\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01af2370aa95ff841349c2b465f25f3b2c7a7137.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\frac{29k}{1+k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"87\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> to be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6edd274b6fbd03a59895030503e167c3c800abc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> must divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/05328cf768367f97df8254832e4be5618108b6e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.\nWhen <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/3/af306fbefa9ed58d769f295fe4504172543551ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/1/171d2a82ce2a2ec9f41a74b542fb2b26b3ea5d45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\frac{29(28)}{29} = 28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"139\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Calculate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> using our value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/e/e5ef9d0c94a21a3bb1b2f440a1c2f534fa9b97a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{29(28)}{29-28} = \\frac{812}{1} = 812$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"207\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/6/1a64f475c79efb7607926e30ae5b1be5ae50db2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n = 28 + 812 = \\boxed{840}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"206\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~ brandonyee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/lH-0ul1hwKw?t=134\">https://youtu.be/lH-0ul1hwKw?t=134</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I\" title=\"2002 AIME I\">2002 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2002\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AIME I Proble